    "basic_qualifications": "- Bachelor's degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, Information Technology, or related fields<br/>- 1+ years of data engineering experience<br/>- Experience with data modeling, warehousing and building ETL pipelines<br/>- Experience with one or more scripting language (e.g., Python, KornShell, Scala)<br/>- Experience with database, data warehouse or data lake solutions",
